    },
    "description": "The adventure is over but life goes on for an elf mage just beginning to learn what living is all about.\n<br><br>\nElf mage Frieren and her courageous fellow adventurers have defeated the Demon King and brought peace to the land. With the great struggle over, they all go their separate ways to live a quiet life. But as an elf, Frieren, nearly immortal, will long outlive the rest of her former party. How will she come to terms with the mortality of her friends? How can she find fulfillment in her own life, and can she learn to understand what life means to the humans around her? Frieren begins a new journey to find the answer.<br><br>\n(Source: VIZ Media)\n<br><br>\n<i>Notes:<br>\n- Winner of the Grand Prize at the 14th Manga Taisho Awards.<br>\n- Nominated for the 25th Annual Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize.<br>\n- Placed 3rd at the 7th Annual Next Manga Award.</i>",
